  - 'Mr. Smith: But I met the Duck here.'
  - 'Rana: Oh uh, congradulations. '
  - 'Mr. Smith: My Pa never let us have pets. '
  - 'Rana: Well I''m glad you found something you love.'
  - 'Mr. Smith: That''s what were all looking for. '
