  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - '???: Ah! Please don''t kill me. I just needed some shade.'
  - 'Rana: Chill man, you can hang out in the shade I''m just checking town out.'
  - '???: Oh your not from here? '
  - 'Rana: Nah I''m traveling too.'
  - '???: That''s a relief. The people here really don''t like me. '
  - 'Rana: Well that''s not nice.'
  - '???: You just staying in town? '
  - 'Rana: Yeah, I actually have a bar here too. I move location a lot though.'
  - '???: That''s cool. '
  - 'Rana: I never got your name by the way.'
  - '???: I''m Jeffery. '
  - 'Jeffery: Is your bar open to everyone?'
